        "text": "Extract the complete content of this CV. Read all pages, including scanned or image-based text.\n\nReturn the information in a clear, structured format:\n\n1. Candidate's full name\n2. Email address\n3. Phone number\n4. Highest academic qualification\n5. Field of study\n6. Educational institutions and graduation years\n7. Total years of relevant work experience\n8. Previous employment and job responsibilities\n9. Technical and laboratory skills\n10. Food microbiology and quality control experience\n11. HACCP, GMP, ISO 22000 or other food safety training\n12. Professional certifications\n13. Relevant research experience and publications\n\nDo not invent missing information. Write \"Not stated\" where information is unavailable. Preserve the candidate's actual qualifications and experience. Return the extracted information in a readable, structured format.",
        "inputType": "binary",
        "options": {}
      },
